
this is for clamAV,

run ClamAV

install the ClamAV,

after install follow this process:- open note as admistrators > open the ClamAV folder > search for conf_examples folder
> make sure you change 'text document .txt' to 'all files' then you can see freshclam.conf.sample file open it
> delete or put # infront of 'Example' line > then click save as and save as freshclam.conf change 'text document .txt' to 'all files' it in ClamAV main folder.   

open cmd as admistrators then go to ClamAV dir > then run ./freshclam.conf

After ClamAV: go to windows security > virus and threat protection > click on manage setting of virus and threat protection
> scroll down and search for add or remove exclusions > add > seach for the digitvault project folder and select the folder.

this will allow windows to ignor the virus contant file which we are goingto to test for project.


